{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basket Bots is a 1v1 physical based Basket Ball game.\u00a0Control a bot, push the ball into the basket, score, win. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play for fun, bounce the ball everywhere, and enjoy your good (or bad) luck.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with skill, aim the right angle to score a 3 points, roll to protect yourself,\u00a0jump with the right timing to defend you basket and destroy you opponent !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the physic !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, Dash or Roll to bounce the ball and score 2 or 3 points !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/88c79c8a8a66a9b3ca23c4c642642181.poster.avif?t=1758206553\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/88c79c8a8a66a9b3ca23c4c642642181.webm?t=1758206553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/88c79c8a8a66a9b3ca23c4c642642181.mp4?t=1758206553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destroy your opponent</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash toward your enemy to break it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/2e1b5862c69c925033ba4a8bb2ff9a55.poster.avif?t=1758206553\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/2e1b5862c69c925033ba4a8bb2ff9a55.webm?t=1758206553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/extras/2e1b5862c69c925033ba4a8bb2ff9a55.mp4?t=1758206553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect pickups to change the game\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch up to 8 different bonus. Get faster, bigger, or modify the arena.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play locally versus a friend or an AI</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a controller is recommended, but keyboard input is working.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725900?t=1758206553","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725900?t=1758206553","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/f802ed61e09c8885a72e5fea9936e8d38aa717b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758206553","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725900/f802ed61e09c8885a72e5fea9936e8d38aa717b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758206553","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4019330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basket Bots is a 1v1 physical based Basket Ball game.\u00a0Control a bot, push the ball into the basket, score, win. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play for fun, bounce the ball everywhere, and enjoy your good (or bad) luck.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with skill, aim the right angle to score a 3 points, ro